<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">rename</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">rename</ansi> command lets you change your character's name. The new
name must be unique across all players, companions, and mob templates.
After a successful rename, you cannot rename again until the cooldown
has passed (default: 7 days).

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">rename</ansi> <ansi fg="cyan">&lt;newname&gt;</ansi>     Change your character's name.

You will be asked to confirm before the rename takes effect.
Type <ansi fg="51">yes</ansi> to proceed, anything else to abort.

<ansi fg="yellow">Example: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">rename Bobblesworth</ansi>
